7classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0724\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser realizada de forma que garanta a manuten\134u00e7\134u00e3o das condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es higi\134u00eanico\055 sanit\134u00e1rias satisfat\134u00f3rias e minimize o risco de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o das \134u00e1guas\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser realizada por funcion\134u00e1rios comprovadamente capacitados\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Devem ser mantidos registros das opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i10\137u2\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i10\137u2\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i10\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i11\137u2\042\054\042serial\042\07211\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPHO\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i11\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i11\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0724\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i11\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i11\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar\054 quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 o desmonte da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o e prever a freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia de realiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o desta opera\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Caso seja constatada a presen\134u00e7a de incrusta\134u00e7\134u00f5es e de outras altera\134u00e7\134u00f5es que possam comprometer a qualidade higi\134u00eanico\055sanit\134u00e1ria da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural\054 devem ser revistas as opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o e adotadas as medidas corretivas necess\134u00e1rias\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i11\137u2\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i11\137u2\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i11\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i12\137u2\042\054\042serial\042\07212\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPHO\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i12\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i12\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0724\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i12\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i12\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042O estabelecimento deve desenvolver\054 implementar e manter\054 al\134u00e9m dos POP exigidos na Resolu\134u00e7\134u00e3o \133xx\135\054 de \133dd\135 de \133mmmm\135 de \133aaaa\135\054 procedimento sobre opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042O POP sobre higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o das instala\134u00e7\134u00f5es\054 equipamentos\054 utens\134u00edlios e m\134u00f3veis deve contemplar as opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 conforme requisitos estabelecidos\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Os POP devem conter informa\134u00e7\134u00f5es sobre\072 natureza da superf\134u00edcie a ser higienizada\054 m\134u00e9todos de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 princ\134u00edpios ativos utilizados e sua concentra\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 tempo de contato dos agentes qu\134u00edmicos e ou f\134u00edsicos utilizados na opera\134u00e7\134u00e3o de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 temperatura\054 freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia e outras informa\134u00e7\134u00f5es que se fizerem necess\134u00e1rias\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i12\137u2\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i12\137u2\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i12\1371\042\135\175\135\054\042metadata\042\072\133\042p2\137identificacao\1370\1371\042\135\054\042percent\042\072\042p2\137percent\137u2\042\054\042risk\042\072\042p2\137risk\137u2\042\175\054\173\042proc\042\072\0424\0562\042\054\042page\042\0722\054\042column\042\0722\054\042label\042\072\0423\042\054\042items\042\072\133\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u3\042\054\042serial\042\0726\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPR\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0722\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o para condu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural ou da \134u00e1gua natural deve estar situada em n\134u00edvel superior ao solo \050no m\134u00ednimo 30cm\051\054 ser mantida em adequado estado de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 n\134u00e3o apresentar vazamentos e permitir o acesso para inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o visual\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u3\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u3\137nc\042\05