3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 conforme requisitos estabelecidos\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Os POP devem conter informa\134u00e7\134u00f5es sobre\072 natureza da superf\134u00edcie a ser higienizada\054 m\134u00e9todos de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 princ\134u00edpios ativos utilizados e sua concentra\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 tempo de contato dos agentes qu\134u00edmicos e ou f\134u00edsicos utilizados na opera\134u00e7\134u00e3o de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 temperatura\054 freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia e outras informa\134u00e7\134u00f5es que se fizerem necess\134u00e1rias\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i12\137u3\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i12\137u3\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i12\1371\042\135\175\135\054\042metadata\042\072\133\042p2\137identificacao\1370\1372\042\135\054\042percent\042\072\042p2\137percent\137u3\042\054\042risk\042\072\042p2\137risk\137u3\042\175\054\173\042proc\042\072\0424\0562\042\054\042page\042\0722\054\042column\042\0723\054\042label\042\072\0424\042\054\042items\042\072\133\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\0726\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPR\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0722\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i6\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o para condu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural ou da \134u00e1gua natural deve estar situada em n\134u00edvel superior ao solo \050no m\134u00ednimo 30cm\051\054 ser mantida em adequado estado de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 n\134u00e3o apresentar vazamentos e permitir o acesso para inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o visual\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u4\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i6\137u4\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i6\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i7\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\0727\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PC\042\054\042PPR\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i7\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i7\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0723\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i7\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i7\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve atender \134u00e0 Resolu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da Diretoria Colegiada \055 RDC n\134u00ba 91\054 de 2001\054 outros regulamentos t\134u00e9cnicos espec\134u00edficos referentes ao material constituinte e suas altera\134u00e7\134u00f5es\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PC\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042As superf\134u00edcies da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o que entram em contato com as \134u00e1guas devem ser lisas\054 \134u00edntegras\054 imperme\134u00e1veis\054 resistentes \134u00e0 corros\134u00e3o e de f\134u00e1cil higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042As tubula\134u00e7\134u00f5es n\134u00e3o devem ter zonas mortas sanit\134u00e1rias internas que impe\134u00e7am a limpeza por sistemas de circula\134u00e7\134u00e3o autom\134u00e1tica \050CIP \134u2013 Clean\055in\055 Place\051 utilizados para impedir a prolifera\134u00e7\134u00e3o de biofilmes\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i7\137u4\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i7\137u4\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i7\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i8\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\0728\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPR\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i8\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i8\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0724\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i8\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i8\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042As canaliza\134u00e7\134u00f5es de condu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural ou da \134u00e1gua natural devem ser independentes e sem conex\134u00e3o com as demais \134u00e1guas provenientes de sistema ou solu\134u00e7\134u00e3o alternativa de abastecimento\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i8\137u4\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i8\137u4\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i8\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i9\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\0729\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PCC\042\054\042PPRO\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i9\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i9\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0721\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i9\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i9\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A \134u00e1gua mineral natural e a \134u00e1gua natural podem ser filtradas e os elementos filtrantes devem ser constitu\134u00eddos de material que n\134u00e3o altere as caracter\134u00edsticas originais e a qualidade higi\134u00eanico\055sanit\134u00e1ria dessas \134u00e1guas\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042na\042\072true\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Esses elementos devem ser verificados e trocados na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\054 sendo mantidos os registros\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042na\042\072true\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i9\137u4\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i9\137u4\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i9\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i10\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\07210\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPHO\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137peso\042\054\042probability\042\0724\054\042probabilityField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137probabilidade\042\054\042ncField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i10\137criticidade\042\054\042phrases\042\072\133\173\042text\042\072\042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser realizada de forma que garanta a manuten\134u00e7\134u00e3o das condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es higi\134u00eanico\055 sanit\134u00e1rias satisfat\134u00f3rias e minimize o risco de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o das \134u00e1guas\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser realizada por funcion\134u00e1rios comprovadamente capacitados\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\054\173\042text\042\072\042Devem ser mantidos registros das opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es\056\042\054\042cls\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042na\042\072false\175\135\054\042phraseField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i10\137u4\137frases\042\054\042unitNcField\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i10\137u4\137nc\042\054\042editorTemplates\042\072\133\042APPCC\137Frases\137i10\1371\042\135\175\054\173\042answer\042\072\042p2\137cond\137i11\137u4\042\054\042serial\042\07211\054\042classes\042\072\133\042PPHO\042\135\054\042classField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\137i11\137classe\042\054\042weightField\042\072\042p2\137appcc\